<title>USA: Family Dollar names James Kelly vice-chair.</title>
<headline>Family Dollar names James Kelly vice-chair.</headline>
<dateline>MATTHEWS, N.C. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Family Dollar Stores said Tuesday it named R. James Kelly to the newly created position of vice chairman-chief financial and administrative officer.</p>
<p>Kelly will have responsibility for all financial and administrative departments.</p>
<p>Kelly, 49, has served Family Dollar for the past four years as a partner of Price Waterhouse LLP, the Company's independent accountants.</p>
